  "input_text": "One route applies p0 -> m0 to p0 to establish m0, and then m0 -> p1 to establish p1. A second route joins p0 and d0 into p0 & d0 and applies (p0 & d0) -> p1 to establish p1. Both are presented here; I do not select one as the path taken.",
